                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>In a newspaper interview granted September 3, 1951, Mr. Dulles replied to certain
                    assertions made by the Government of the U.S.S.R. regarding the preparation and
                    content of the Japanese Peace Treaty. For text, see Department of State <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>, September 17, 1951, page 461.</p>
            </div>
